**Build tool:** Maven (`/home/daniel/sandbox/pom.xml`; wrapper `./mvnw`). No Gradle files present.
**Run tests:** `./mvnw test` (or full build/verify `./mvnw verify`). Single test: `./mvnw test -Dtest=AcceptanceTest`. Tests use JUnit 5 + Spring Boot `@SpringBootTest` + MockMvc (`spring-boot-starter-test`, `spring-boot-starter-webmvc-test`).

---

## 1 & 2. Owner entity and its fields

`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Owner.java`
The Owner extends `Person` and adds these fields (lines 38-64):
- `address`, `city`, `telephone`, `email`
