**DB schema** defines the column in all four dialects, e.g. `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/db/h2/schema.sql:39` `registration_date DATE,` (also `hsqldb/schema.sql:46`, `mysql/schema.sql:36`, `postgres/schema.sql:34`).

