```
Format `<customerCode>-M<YY>` (last two digits of the registration date's year).

**Daily create-limit enforcement** — `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/RequireDailyRegistrationLimit.java:15-33`:
```java
private static final int DAILY_LIMIT = 100;

public void service(OwnerRepository ownerRepository) throws DailyRegistrationLimitException {
    LocalDate today = LocalDate.now();
    int count = 0;
    for (Owner existing : ownerRepository.findAll()) {
        if (today.equals(existing.getRegistrationDate())) {
            count++;
        }
    }
    if (count >= DAILY_LIMIT) {
        throw new DailyRegistrationLimitException(
